{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":300,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_1024_00_01","textHome":"知道二木市这个地方吗？@树里大人以前可是那里一个叫龙崎的地区的老大。@现在嘛，倒是和姐姐、妹妹一起，@当起了 Promised Blood 三姐妹。@有空也来我们这儿玩玩吧？我会好好招待你的。"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.5,"chara":[{"id":102400,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.4,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":102400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.6,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":1}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.5,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":102400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":102400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.3,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_012.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":200}]}],"group_10":[{"autoTurnFirst":5.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":300,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_1024_00_17","textHome":"强的家伙统统打倒，火大了就大闹一场。@这种杀气腾腾的世界才让人热血沸腾，@既痛快又来劲。太平日子有什么用！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.6,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":1}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":100}]}],"group_11":[{"autoTurnFirst":5.1,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":1,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_1024_00_18","textHome":"这场战斗结束后，要是还活着，@该干些什么呢……先跟姐姐再打一场吧。@没有敌人的世界，对树里大人来说也太寂寞了。"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.8,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_012.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":6.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":300}]}],"group_12":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.1,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_012.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":100,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_1024_00_19","textHome":"树里大人的火焰已经迫不及待地想咆哮了！@听见了吧，那积蓄的力量发出的声音！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.3,"chara":[{"id":102400,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"id":102400,"motion":200}]}],"group_13":[{"autoTurnFirst":1.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":1,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_1024_00_20","textHome":"嘿嘿。树里大人是不是@也稍微学会忍耐了？"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.0,"chara":[{"id":102400,"motion":100}]}],"group_14":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.1,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":0,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_1024_00_21","textHome":"弱者又不是树里大人需要超越的对手，@我才没兴趣。只有对自己拳头有信心的家伙尽管来。@我会把你们烤个全熟的。"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.3,"chara":[{"id":102400,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.9,"chara":[{"id":102400,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_012.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":400}]}],"group_15":[{"autoTurnFirst":6.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_032.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":0,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_1024_00_22","textHome":"就算是出于我自己的任性，@我也已经杀过好几个人了。@为了那些逝去的家伙，火焰绝不能熄灭，我也绝不能倒下。@所以我才自称“树里大人”！@哪怕只是虚张声势，也要坚强到最后！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":300}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.2,"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":102400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":102400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.2,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_021.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"id":102400,"motion":100}]}],"group_16":[{"autoTurnFirst":4.1,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":1,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_char_1024_00_23"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.3,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":102400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":102400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":102