02_02","textHome":"既然交给我了，树里大人也会按自己的方式好好干的。虽然心里还是觉得——让我来代班看店，开什么玩笑啊！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.4,"chara":[{"id":102400,"motion":200}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.5,"chara":[{"id":102400,"motion":1}]}],"group_42":[{"autoTurnFirst":1.4,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_021.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":400,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_game_0502_03","textHome":"那边的，明白了吧？要是敢偷哪怕一件东西，就把你烤成全熟！给我做好觉悟！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.8,"chara":[{"id":102400,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.7,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_012.exp3.json","id":102400}]}],"group_43":[{"autoTurnFirst":1.9,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":300,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_game_0502_04","textHome":"欢迎光临——这里备齐了各位需要的商品哦。怎么了？我认真干活也不行吗？"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.1,"chara":[{"id":102400,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.6,"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":102400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.0,"chara":[{"cheek":1,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":200}]}],"group_44":[{"autoTurnFirst":3.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":1,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_game_0502_08","textHome":"一大早就这么来劲啊。树里大人的心可还没开门呢！我还困着呢……啊，烦死了！"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.7,"chara":[{"cheek":1,"eyeClose":1,"id":102400,"motion":300}]},{"autoTurnFirst":0.1,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":102400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":4.7,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"id":102400}]},{"autoTurnFirst":3.0,"chara":[{"id":102400,"motion":100}]},{"autoTurnFirst":1.5,"chara":[{"id":102400,"motion":300}]},{"autoTurnFirst":2.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_060.exp3.json","id":102400}]}],"group_45":[{"autoTurnFirst":2.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":102400,"motion":100,"pos":1,"voice":"vo_game_0502_09","textHome":"啊！什么，树里大人刚才晕过去了？吃了准备好的午饭，然后……然后……难道，被人下药了？"}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.2,"chara":[{"id":102400,"motion":0}]},{"autoTurnFirst":5.